{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"フラワーちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/01/05/3204918/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フラワーって言葉好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フラワー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/01/05/3204918/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにこの花をつけて握手会はしてません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初はつけてみよーかな思ったけどなんかおじけづいてやめた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もたくさんの方来てくださいました！やっぱりあみあみ族はみんな優しくてお話してると楽しいです(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう❤きらききら～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、どうしても言いたかったことが！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間初詣行ったときにね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみくじ引いたらね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと...！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46番の大吉！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フォーティーシックスやぁっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして生まれてはじめての大吉！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはこれはもうね高まりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして確信しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ、能條革命の年だ...ってね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/01/05/3204918/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きらーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、書いてあることによると、\n何事も謙虚に。そして気長に待つこと。焦りすぎない。が重要だそうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー、私すぐに焦るからなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気をつけなければならぬ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんはおみくじの結果いかがなものでした！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教えて教えてー(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/01/05/3204918/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピース"}],"source":"archive"}